  "decision_conditions": [
    "Insufficient information has been provided as to the level of care and how the five residents form a single household.",
    "In the absence of adequate information in respect of the operation of the existing use on site, the Local Planning Authority is not satisfied that the use described in this application would fall within Class C3 (b) of the Use Classes Order 1987 as amended. Therefore, the existing use falls under Class C2 (Residential institutions), which requires planning permission, as it is not within the same use class as a single dwelling house."
